/**
 * generated by stackra gen from src/config/i18n.config.ts, assets/lang/<locale>/<namespace>.json
 * (console, shortcuts, manifest, pages, documents, menus, enums, devices) and the lang sections of
 * the consumed manifests (commerce: catalogue, inventory, orders, loyalty_kit, access_log;
 * notifications: messages; @stackra/queue: queue; platform: settings; experience) — do not edit
 * Purpose: the complete typed key tree of every namespace this app or its generated files
 *          reference, the lazy loaders per namespace and locale (a regional locale loads its
 *          overlay only where one exists), the fallback chains and the overrides gen applied. A
 *          leaf is a branded `I18nKey`, so `t()` refuses a raw string and a typo is a type error.
 * Boundary: keys are `<namespace>::<path>` (ADR 0231); the console's namespaces are one file each
 *           under `assets/lang/<locale>/`, and derived keys sit in the namespace of their kind
 *           (`shortcuts::open_palette.label`, `enums::density.compact`,
 *           `documents::welcome.title`). Consumed namespaces are copied by gen into
 *           `.stackra/lang/` from the producers' committed manifests, so the app never imports a
 *           service. Gen fails on a derived key missing in a base locale, on a key present in one
 *           base locale only, on an overlay key its base lacks and on an Arabic plural missing any
 *           of `zero one two few many other`. `manifest::` is read by gen only, so it has no
 *           loader.
 * Runtime: browser
 */
